OL,5,G1600 Take Four Books
OL,6,     FThe Irish writer, Donal Ryan,
OL,7,     Fspeaks about his latest novel,
OL,8,     FWhere Are The Kings, and, together
OL,9,     Fwith presenter James Crawford,
OL,10,     Fthey explore its connections to
OL,11,     Fthree other books.
