OL,5,G1700 Witness History
OL,6,     FIn 1963, a big sculpture of a
OL,7,     FScotsman appeared outside a motel.
OL,8,     FA banana, a koala, and even a
OL,9,     Fpotato followed, paving the way
OL,10,     Ffor one of the country's quirkiest
OL,11,     Fphenomena.
