OL,6,     FNatasha throws a spanner in the
OL,7,     Fworks, and Eddie is left touched.
OL,8,G1915 Izabela in Peru
OL,9,     FField-recordist Izabela Dluzyk
OL,10,     Ftravels to Peru. Izabela, who was
OL,11,     Fborn blind, knows hundreds of
OL,12,     Fcreature sounds by heart. Listen
OL,13,     Fwith her as she explores the life
OL,14,     Fof the rainforest.
OL,15,G1945 Thief at the British Museum
OL,16,     FIttai Gradel starts buying from a
OL,17,     Fmysterious seller with a seemingly
OL,18,     Fendless supply of ancient,
OL,19,     Fprecious gemstones at bargain
OL,20,     Fprices. But soon his suspicions
OL,21,     Fstart to grow.
